  text: 'Greybox only. Next: ProBuilder walls, NavMeshSurface bake, enemy spawners
    from GateData.

    NavMesh baked by PlayerRigSetup from the Environment-layer
    greybox so teleport works (CMF-7). Placeholder: the level designer rebakes it
    with the real layout.

    Combat Loop (CombatLoopBuilder): goblins in both rooms,
    daggers at the hips, exit portal opens when all goblins are dead. Placeholder
    until the real enemies, weapons and Chieftain land.'
